---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Services — TraceSeis"
  description="TraceSeis provides specialized geoscience services including seismic data processing, feasibility studies, lithofacies prediction, and inversion to reservoir properties."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label-sm" style="color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 8px;">Services</p>
      <h1>Geoscience Services</h1>
      <p class="lead">Specialized geophysical and geological analysis to help reduce risk when quantifying reservoir properties.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 40px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="art-banner" style="height: 240px; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <img src="/images/seismic-waveforms.jpg" alt="Seismic waveform visualization" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card card-accent">
          <h3>Seismic Data Processing</h3>
          <p>Advanced techniques to enhance data quality and resolution with customized workflows tailored to specific geological challenges. TraceSeis applies rigorous processing methodologies to ensure reliable and interpretable seismic data.</p>
          <a href="https://www.traceseis.com/services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">Details on traceseis.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-accent">
          <h3>Feasibility Studies</h3>
          <p>Thorough assessments evaluating data quality, geological complexity, and technical viability. These studies provide the foundation for informed decision-making before committing to larger-scale projects.</p>
          <a href="https://www.traceseis.com/services/feasibility-studies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">Details on traceseis.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-accent">
          <h3>Lithofacies Prediction</h3>
          <p>Accurate predictions using integrated seismic and well-log data combined with rock physics modeling. This service helps characterize subsurface lithology and supports reservoir modeling efforts.</p>
          <a href="https://www.traceseis.com/services-lithofacies-prediction/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">Details on traceseis.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-accent">
          <h3>Inversion to Reservoir Properties</h3>
          <p>Proprietary methodologies that transform seismic attributes into porosity, saturation, and other reservoir parameters. TraceSeis's approach reduces dependency on Low Frequency Models, streamlining the characterization workflow.</p>
          <a href="https://www.traceseis.com/services/inversion-to-reservoir-properties/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-link">Details on traceseis.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Need a tailored solution?</h2>
      <p>Contact TraceSeis to discuss your specific reservoir characterization requirements.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
